"""Seed reviewed English syntax references for every published course.

The seed is deliberately idempotent and only inserts missing slugs. It never
updates existing records, lessons, progress, or translations. Every inserted
entry contains five progressive examples with concrete code and expected
behavior; Burmese translations remain separate review work until supplied.
"""
